  "purpose": "Operational Core 1.4 model-error framework. Approved Research Library v1.8 findings may raise uncertainty/model-error floors and block false precision, but may not lower model error, directly move a fair-value point estimate, create independent current support, create a BET, set stake, or override identity/freshness/personnel/exposure gates. Walters authority is a separate controlled Core 1.4 input.",
  "researchAuthority": {
    "libraryVersion": "1.8",
    "libraryPath": "research/research-library.json",
